        <item>
            <title>1.1.78</title>
            <pubDate>Wed, 30 Sep 2026 08:15:45 +0200</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/BIK-GmbH/desktop-recorder-releases/releases/tag/v1.1.78</link>
            <sparkle:version>1.1.78</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.1.78</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## Knowledge Recorder 1.1.78

- **Comment when sending to the Brain:** an optional comment field in the send dialog adds context the Brain cannot see in the image or video; it becomes its own "Comment" section in the Brain and shows in the viewer's history.
]]></description>
