        </item>
        <item>
            <title>1.1.77</title>
            <pubDate>Wed, 30 Sep 2026 07:22:05 +0200</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/BIK-GmbH/desktop-recorder-releases/releases/tag/v1.1.77</link>
            <sparkle:version>1.1.77</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.1.77</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## Knowledge Recorder 1.1.77

- **Brain history and new versions:** the brain button in the media viewer lists every send with date, time, knowledge area, version and state. After changing an image, "Send new version…" sends it as an additional "(Version 2)" document — the earlier one stays in the Brain.
]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/BIK-GmbH/desktop-recorder-releases/releases/download/v1.1.77/DesktopRecorder-macOS.dmg" length="42403195" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="uSy9qGdw7F3b8KjmyoTTlu4R8LTdNvfvr9az54Q372YQFmRednHq0vUcSL2iNAdulHmD9O+FoU5q+SHk8XBgDQ=="/>
        </item>
        <item>
            <title>1.1.76</title>
            <pubDate>Tue, 29 Sep 2026 23:26:09 +0200</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/BIK-GmbH/desktop-recorder-releases/releases/tag/v1.1.76</link>
            <sparkle:version>1.1.76</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.1.76</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## Knowledge Recorder 1.1.76

- **Media Library to the Brain:** send screenshots and screen recordings to a knowledge area of the Corporate Digital Brain with the company login — right-click an item › "Send to Brain…" or select several and click "Send to Brain". An icon next to the date shows the processing state.
- **Large videos in parts:** videos above 95 MB are uploaded in parts and continue after a lost connection or quitting the app.
]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/BIK-GmbH/desktop-recorder-releases/releases/download/v1.1.76/DesktopRecorder-macOS.dmg" length="42516231" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="4cY0Z6LLUxK0B5TSL0xbxi6QqHGNDuqpefU4yO0xGYHir3KJ58Nu6qIf3mlxLGBm+kAnXKrKJWK+wPkkLhlaAQ=="/>
